ind":"update","title":"Patch Notes: 0.2.19","summary":"Content added:Tile Enhancement: EscalationTile Edition: Stone (Only available in full game, not demo)Visual Enhancement:Tile Enhancement effects slightly rotate when triggered.Bug Fix:Mashing the button to upgrade tile value no longer works, and also prevents a related soft lock.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T14:53:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165583607","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:56:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4124240-1832700592789921","game_id":"steam-4124240","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes: 0.2.16","summary":"Added following new Tile Enhancements to the demo:Deuce: +1 Mult when played in a word with only 2 tiles.Resonance: +1 Value for each tile on board that has this enhancement.GrowerCorner OfficeInvestmentVeteranDeuce and Resonance are default unlocks, while the others require completing objectives to unlock them. Find out what they do by unlocking them!Also, the Turn Boost totem has been nerfed to only give additional turn on stages 1 & 2, not on Boss stages.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-14T17:22:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592789921","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:56:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4124240-1832065502809996","game_id":"steam-4124240","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is Now Live!","summary":"I am incredibly excited to announce that a playable demo of Letterally is now available to download and play right here on Steam!While the game is still in active development, it is now fully playable and feature-complete, with added improvements based on feedback from the recent open playtest.Demo ContentTo keep the full experience a surprise, the demo features a curated slice of gameplay:5 Playable Levels: Get a feel for the progression and word-building mechanics.8 Boss Encounters: Test your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-06T18:30:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502809996","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:56:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4124240-1827626365761518","game_id":"steam-4124240","kind":"announcement","title":"Letterally Open Playtest: Now Live!","summary":"The wait is over! You can now finally test Letterally.After a successful brief closed playtest, it will be opened to the public for the next few weeks. This is a crucial step for the game's development, and your contributions at this stage will be greatly appreciated.How you can help:Content Ideas: Got an idea for a new boss ability or a wild Tile mechanic? Let us know.Balance & Difficulty: Roguelike word games are notoriously tough to balance, and the word finding mechanic makes it so much hard","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-22T12:15:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365761518","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:56:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4124240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:14Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4124240":"2026-10-26T01:46:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4124240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4430830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"ga